lure, then it is not a leadership strategy—it is a gamble with our collective future. We must shift the burden of proof onto those who claim that high-speed iteration is a substitute for verified, secure foundations, and acknowledge that true strategic dominance is found in the integrity of our systems, not merely the speed of their release.",
